    "description": "The Generalized Acceptance of EvolutioN Evaluation (GAENE) is a 13-item self-report scale measuring the degree to which individuals accept the scientific theory of evolution. It is used in science education research to assess evolutionary understanding and acceptance independent of religious or personal beliefs.",
